{"unit_id":"Jorgen233__dsh-why-reject-me#card-zh","repo":"Jorgen233/dsh-why-reject-me","commit":"e0be40d4ac2cf08e3c76c2a98af27559d030628d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-why-reject-me 是一个面向 DSH Desktop 网页界面的权限审批插件，会接管待处理的审批面板并加入可选的拒绝原因输入框。拒绝时，插件先把原因提交给 Host，再将它附加到对应的被拒绝工具结果，让模型在同一轮读取；留空拒绝和允许一次都保持原有行为。面板提供中英文提示、键盘快捷操作、错误重试和按会话及工具调用保存的短期草稿。它适合希望通过拒绝理由引导模型改用其他方案的 DSH Desktop 用户。运行不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:452-470","index.js:117-125"]}
{"unit_id":"Jorgen233__dsh-why-reject-me#card-en","repo":"Jorgen233/dsh-why-reject-me","commit":"e0be40d4ac2cf08e3c76c2a98af27559d030628d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-why-reject-me adds a reason field to DSH Desktop approval prompts. On rejection, it attaches the reason to the matching tool result for the model. Empty rejection and allowing once preserve original behavior. It supports shortcuts and temporary drafts; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:452-470","index.js:117-125"]}
