{"unit_id":"Jorgen233__dsh-why-reject-me#feature-1","repo":"Jorgen233/dsh-why-reject-me","commit":"e0be40d4ac2cf08c3e76c2a98af27559d030628d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-why-reject-me 的功能「拒绝时附加理由」：在权限审批面板输入原因并选择拒绝，客户端提交原因，Host 将它追加到对应工具结果供模型读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:304-320","index.js:90-107"]}
{"unit_id":"Jorgen233__dsh-why-reject-me#feature-2","repo":"Jorgen233/dsh-why-reject-me","commit":"e0be40d4ac2cf08e3c76c2a98af27559d030628d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-why-reject-me 的功能「保留原生审批选择」：原因留空时可直接拒绝，选择允许一次则调用原审批回答，不会发送输入框文字。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:304-320"]}
{"unit_id":"Jorgen233__dsh-why-reject-me#feature-3","repo":"Jorgen233/dsh-why-reject-me","commit":"e0be40d4ac2cf08e3c76c2a98af27559d030628d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-why-reject-me 的功能「审批面板快捷键」：面板支持 Ctrl/⌘+Enter 拒绝并附上原因，Escape 可拒绝或在输入框有内容时先让其失焦。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:329-362"]}
{"unit_id":"Jorgen233__dsh-why-reject-me#feature-4","repo":"Jorgen233/dsh-why-reject-me","commit":"e0be40d4ac2cf08e3c76c2a98af27559d030628d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-why-reject-me 的功能「审批原因草稿」：输入内容按会话和工具调用暂存，切换会话后可恢复；草稿在内存中保留至多 30 分钟。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:11-12","client.js:19-59","client.js:408-412"]}
{"unit_id":"Jorgen233__dsh-why-reject-me#caveat-1","repo":"Jorgen233/dsh-why-reject-me","commit":"e0be40d4ac2cf08e3c76c2a98af27559d030628d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-why-reject-me 使用前须知：填写的理由会被追加到拒绝工具结果中，供模型读取；选择允许一次不会发送该理由。（见 index.js:103-107、client.js:304-320）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:103-107","client.js:304-320"]}
{"unit_id":"Jorgen233__dsh-why-reject-me#caveat-2","repo":"Jorgen233/dsh-why-reject-me","commit":"e0be40d4ac2cf08e3c76c2a98af27559d030628d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-why-reject-me 使用前须知：客户端明确跳过子代理会话中的审批，因此这类会话不会显示插件的拒绝理由输入面板。（见 client.js:242-244、client.js:461-464）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:242-244","client.js:461-464"]}
